flowchart LR
  V[SpeechRecognizer / typed question] --> U[Compose Android client]
  U --> H[HTTPS farmpi.local]
  H --> F[FastAPI]
  F -->|answer, provenance, chart, diagnostics, node state| U
  U --> T[Native TextToSpeech: chunk, stop, retry, diagnostics]
  U --> P[SharedPreferences]
  P --> S[Explanation / guidance preferences]
  P --> C[Six themes]
  P --> Z[Compact / standard / large text size]
  U --> G[Interactive chart renderer]
  G --> M[Line / area-day profile / bars / dots]
  U --> N[Nodes administration]
  N -->|session-only administrator token| H
  N --> R[Pending / registered nodes, location, config, sync, sensor state]
